What is new in this project:
    the unified agent event schema, the loopback event bridge, the multi-session
    state machine, the cross-host adapters (DeepSeek Harness, Claude Code, Codex,
    Cursor, WorkBuddy, TRAE), the Electron desktop companion, the installer and
    rollback tooling, and the tests. Those files were written for this project.

